        "summary": "Weak intramolecular antiferromagnetic interactions and magnetic anisotropy. Room-temperature χMT is close to six uncoupled Dy(III) ions. Magnetization at 2 K does not saturate at 7 T. Frequency-dependent out-of-phase ac signals under zero dc field indicate slow magnetization relaxation, but no χ″ peaks; a Debye-type estimate gives Ea = 2.36 K and τ0 = 5.96×10−6 s.",
